00:20:25.679 --> 00:20:29.283
>> SECOND COLLEAGUES TODAY I AM INTRODUCING AN ORDINANCE THAT

00:20:29.283 --> 00:20:30.818
WILL ALLOW FOR BUILDERS TO TAKE FULL ADVANTAGE OF THE BUILDING

00:20:30.818 --> 00:20:33.754
CODE WHEN IT COMES TO INCLUDING MEZZANINE, MEZZANINE OR SPACES

00:20:33.754 --> 00:20:37.758
BETWEEN FLOORS OF A BUILDING THAT DO NOT TAKE UP THE FULL

00:20:37.758 --> 00:20:41.762
FOOTPRINT OF A BUILDING USUALLY SITUATED ABOVE A PORTION OF THE

00:20:41.762 --> 00:20:42.830
GROUND FLOOR. THEY ALLOW FOR BUILDINGS TO

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:45.833
HAVE HIGH CEILINGS IN ONE PART OF A SPACE WHILE ALLOWING FOR

00:20:45.833 --> 00:20:49.237
MORE FOCUSED SPACE IN A SMALL PORTION OF THE BUILDING.

00:20:49.237 --> 00:20:53.174
UNDER THE BUILDING CODE THOUGH, MEZZANINE CAN BE UP TO 50% OF

00:20:53.174 --> 00:20:57.377
THE AREA OF THE FLOOR BELOW SO LONG AS THE SPACE HAS PROPER

00:20:57.377 --> 00:20:58.512
SPRINKLERS. >> THE PLANNING CODE, HOWEVER,

00:20:58.512 --> 00:21:01.783
HAS A DIFFERENT RULE. IT LIMITS MEZZANINE TO JUST ONE

00:21:01.783 --> 00:21:04.785
THIRD OF THE FOOTPRINT. >> THIS IS DESPITE THE FACT

00:21:04.785 --> 00:21:06.186
THAT EXPERTS WHO COMPILE THE BUILDING CODE HAVE NO LIFE

00:21:06.186 --> 00:21:08.856
SAFETY ISSUES WITH A BIGGER MEZZANINE.

00:21:08.856 --> 00:21:11.726
THIS MEANS IF YOU WANT TO BUILD A BUILDING WITH THREE STORIES

00:21:11.726 --> 00:21:13.194
AND A MEZZANINE BIGGER THAN ONE THIRD THE SIZE OF THE FLOOR

00:21:13.194 --> 00:21:16.330
THAT COUNTS AS A THREE STOREY BUILDING UNDER THE BUILDING

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:19.200
CODE BUT A FOUR STORY BUILDING AND THE PLANNING CODE.

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:22.870
THIS CONFLICT LED TO CONFUSION FOR A PROJECT IN DISTRICT FIVE

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:26.273
WHERE A MEZZANINE WAS COUNTED AS A FLOOR DURING CODE REVIEW.

00:21:26.273 --> 00:21:29.544
ANY SORT OF DELAY AND AMBIGUITY CAN COST TIME FOR PROJECTS

00:21:29.544 --> 00:21:31.110
IN THIS AMBIGUITY MAY LEAD TO ARCHITECTS NOT TAKING FULL

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:34.415
ADVANTAGE OF THE TOOLS AT THEIR ARSENAL TO MAXIMIZE USABLE

00:21:34.415 --> 00:21:38.180
SPACE AND OUR DENSITY. FOR SOME PROJECTS THE EXTRA

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:41.422
FLOOR THAT THE PLANNING DEPARTMENT COUNTS COULD HAVE

00:21:41.422 --> 00:21:44.726
CASCADING EFFECTS ON THE USES ALLOWED IN THE FINAL BUILDING.

00:21:44.726 --> 00:21:46.561
SO THIS LEGISLATION WILL BRING THE TWO CODES INTO ALIGNMENT.

00:21:46.561 --> 00:21:49.830
CLEANING UP ANY CONFUSION AND ALLOWING FOR MORE USABLE

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:53.101
SPACE IN OUR NEW CONSTRUCTION BUILDINGS WITHOUT JEOPARDIZING

00:21:53.101 --> 00:21:54.350
SAFETY. THANK YOU TO DEPUTY CITY

