ATTORNEY ROB KAPLAN, RACHEL COOPER AND MY TEAM FOR WORKING

00:21:57.171 --> 00:22:00.375
ON THIS AS WELL AS LISA GLUCKSTEIN AND ELIZABETH GORDON

00:22:00.375 --> 00:22:03.778
JUNKER FROM THE PLANNING DEPARTMENT FOR THEIR INPUT.

00:22:03.778 --> 00:22:08.182
ALSO THANKS TO GILLIAN ALLEN, BRIAN HARDY AND REZA CUSHION OF

00:22:08.182 --> 00:22:12.453
ONION FOR BRINGING THIS SUBJECT TO OUR ATTENTION.

00:22:12.453 --> 00:22:13.721
COLLEAGUES, I ASK FOR YOUR SUPPORT FOR THIS LEGISLATION

00:22:13.721 --> 00:22:16.123
THAT TAKES THE BUILDING AND PLANNING CODE HARMONIZATION

00:22:16.123 --> 00:22:19.527
TO ANOTHER LEVEL OR AT LEAST ON ANOTHER MEZZANINE.

00:22:19.527 --> 00:22:20.595
>> THE REST I SUBMIT. THANK YOU.

00:22:20.595 --> 00:22:23.464
SUPERVISOR MAHMOOD. >> SUPERVISOR RANDLEMAN THANK

00:22:23.464 --> 00:22:27.135
YOU, MADAM CLERK. COLLEAGUES I'M ASKING THAT WE

00:22:27.135 --> 00:22:31.900
ADJOURN TODAY'S MEETING IN MEMORY OF MICHAEL FRANK RICE

00:22:31.900 --> 00:22:32.410
WHO PREVIOUSLY SERVED AS THE PRESIDENT OF THE GLEN PARK

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:38.783
ASSOCIATION AND MICHAEL DIED ON MAY 31ST AT THE AGE OF 79.

00:22:38.783 --> 00:22:40.218
MICHAEL WAS BORN IN 1947 IN PARIS, FRANCE.

00:22:40.218 --> 00:22:43.621
>> HIS FATHER JAMES WAS A SOCIAL WORKER SENT OVERSEAS TO

00:22:43.621 --> 00:22:47.224
HELP RESETTLE JEWISH HOLOCAUST SURVIVORS IN AUSTRIA.

00:22:47.224 --> 00:22:48.760
HE AND HIS FAMILY, HIS PARENTS AND HIS OLDER BROTHER MOVED

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:51.296
FROM PARIS. THEN TO SWITZERLAND, THEN TO

00:22:51.296 --> 00:22:54.766
GERMANY BEFORE ULTIMATELY RETURNING TO THE UNITED STATES

00:22:54.766 --> 00:22:56.330
AND SETTLING SETTLING IN EAST CHESTER, NEW YORK.

00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:59.236
MICHAEL FOLLOWED HIS BROTHER TO BOWDOIN COLLEGE IN MAINE

00:22:59.236 --> 00:23:02.373
INITIALLY STUDYING CHEMISTRY. HOWEVER, AN AVID READER

00:23:02.373 --> 00:23:06.310
AND TALENTED WRITER, HE SOON REALIZED HIS INTERESTS LAY

00:23:06.310 --> 00:23:07.512
ELSEWHERE AND SWITCHED HIS MAJOR TO ART HISTORY.

00:23:07.512 --> 00:23:10.448
>> AFTER GRADUATING HE WENT ON TO EARN A MASTER'S IN URBAN

00:23:10.448 --> 00:23:13.784
PLANNING AT THE UNIVERSITY OF MICHIGAN, ACCORDING TO HIS WIFE

00:23:13.784 --> 00:23:16.654
JANE. >> MICHAEL LOVED BIG CITIES

00:23:16.654 --> 00:23:17.989
AND LIKE NOTHING BETTER THAN FIGURING OUT A NEW PUBLIC

00:23:17.989 --> 00:23:20.992
TRANSPORTATION SYSTEM. IN 1972 HE PACKED HIS THINGS

00:23:20.992 --> 00:23:25.396
INTO HIS YELLOW TOYOTA COROLLA AND DROVE ACROSS ACROSS THE

00:23:25.396 --> 00:23:28.800
COUNTRY FROM PROVIDENCE, RHODE ISLAND TO SAN FRANCISCO.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:32.300
TWO YEARS LATER HE MET JANE WHO HAD SIMILARLY TO HER BELONGINGS

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:35.240
INTO HER VW BUG AND MOVED FROM LOS ANGELES TO SAN FRANCISCO.

00:23:35.240 --> 00:23:38.876
THE COUPLE MARRIED IN 1977. THE FOLLOWING YEAR THEY

00:23:38.876 --> 00:23:41.813
WELCOMED THEIR FIRST SON JOEL AND THEIR SECOND SON NATHAN

00:23:41.813 --> 00:23:42.880
IN 1980. >> THE YOUNG FAMILY LIVED

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:45.883
BRIEFLY IN THE CASTRO AND BERNAL HEIGHTS BEFORE

00:23:45.883 --> 00:23:49.870
SETTLING IN GLEN PARK. AFTER MOVING TO THE

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:50.621
NEIGHBORHOOD, MICHAEL ATTENDED A FATEFUL GLEN PARK ASSOCIATION

00:23:50.621 --> 00:23:54.250
MEETING WHERE HE PARTICIPATED IN A DEBATE ABOUT THE PROPOSED

00:23:54.250 --> 00:23:56.761
REBUILDING OF THE DEYOUNG MUSEUM, WHICH HAD BEEN

00:23:56.761 --> 00:23:59.831
CRITICALLY DAMAGED BY THE 1989 LOMA PRIETA EARTHQUAKE.

00:23:59.831 --> 00:24:03.901
MICHAEL, WHO HAD WRITTEN COUNTLESS ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACT

00:24:03.901 --> 00:24:07.638
REPORTS FOR PROJECTS INVOLVING ORACLE PARK, THE ACADEMY OF

00:24:07.638 --> 00:24:09.400
SCIENCES, GOLDEN GATE PARK MISSION BAY AND MORE WAS WELL

00:24:09.400 --> 00:24:11.440
SPOKEN AND CLEARLY KNOWLEDGEABLE.

00:24:12.243 --> 00:24:15.713
>> HE IMMEDIATELY CAUGHT THE ATTENTION OF ZOLAN NORDSTROM,

00:24:15.713 --> 00:24:19.851
THEN PRESIDENT OF THE GLEN PARK ASSOCIATION WHO INVITED HIM TO

00:24:19.851 --> 00:24:23.854
JOIN AND TOLD HIM HE WOULD BE PERFECT AS THE NEXT PRESIDENT.

00:24:23.854 --> 00:24:27.458
>> SO ANSWER TURNED OUT TO BE CORRECT.

00:24:27.458 --> 00:24:31.328
MICHAEL WENT ON TO SERVE AS PRESIDENT OF THE GLEN PARK

00:24:31.328 --> 00:24:34.465
ASSOCIATION FOR 12 YEARS AND HIS EXPERTISE, CARE

00:24:34.465 --> 00:24:37.735
AND THOUGHTFUL LEADERSHIP HELPED SHAPED GLEN PARK INTO

00:24:37.735 --> 00:24:39.203
THE NEIGHBORHOOD IT IS TODAY WHICH I WOULD NOTE HAS BEEN

00:24:39.203 --> 00:24:43.700
RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE 40 COOLEST NEIGHBORHOODS IN THE

00:24:43.700 --> 00:24:48.407
WORLD BY TIMEOUT MAGAZINE AFTER THE DIMOND SUPERMARKET BURNED

00:24:48.412 --> 00:24:49.613
DOWN IN 1998. SIX YEARS OF CONTENTIOUS DEBATE

00:24:49.613 --> 00:24:52.616
FOLLOWED AS PEOPLE SPARRED OVER HOW THE SITE SHOULD BE

00:24:52.616 --> 00:24:55.686
REDEVELOPED. >> GLEN PARK A MAJORITY OF GLEN

00:24:55.686 --> 00:24:59.157
PARK NEIGHBORS FAVORED A PROPOSAL TO BUILD A SUPERMARKET

00:24:59.157 --> 00:25:02.693
WITH A LIBRARY ON THE SECOND FLOOR AND ADD 15 UNITS OF

00:25:02.693 --> 00:25:03.761
HOUSING. >> DESPITE THE NEIGHBORHOOD'S

00:25:03.761 --> 00:25:07.364
OVERALL SUPPORT, A SMALL GROUP FOUGHT TO BLOCK THIS PROJECT AT

00:25:07.364 --> 00:25:10.501
EVERY TURN. CIRCULATING DOCTORED IMAGES OF

00:25:10.501 --> 00:25:14.172
THE PROPOSAL AND EXPLOITING THE CITY'S CONVOLUTED BUREAUCRATIC

00:25:14.172 --> 00:25:15.306
PROCESSES. THIS MAY SOUND FAMILIAR TO

00:25:15.306 --> 00:25:18.853
MEMBERS OF THIS BOARD, HOWEVER MICHAEL, WHO HAS STUDIED EVERY

00:25:18.853 --> 00:25:22.560
LAWSUIT ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACT REPORT AND CITY DOCUMENT

00:25:22.560 --> 00:25:23.124
PERSISTED IN PUSHING THE PROJECT THROUGH.

00:25:23.124 --> 00:25:26.728
HIS DILIGENCE PAID OFF AND TODAY THAT AREA IS HOME TO

00:25:26.728 --> 00:25:29.597
THE CANYON MARKET AND THE GLEN PARK LIBRARY WHICH HAVE BECOME

00:25:29.597 --> 00:25:33.134
BELOVED FIXTURES IN GLEN PARK. AMONG MICHAEL'S MANY OTHER

00:25:33.134 --> 00:25:36.338
ACCOMPLISHMENTS WERE HELPING TRANSFORM AN OVERGROWN STRIP OF

00:25:36.338 --> 00:25:39.674
LAND INTO THE GLEN PARK GREENWAY A LUSH THREE BLOCK

00:25:39.674 --> 00:25:41.900
CORRIDOR THAT REMAINS A SOURCE OF NEIGHBORHOOD PRIDE.

00:25:41.900 --> 00:25:43.878
